&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders across the company to build new features at large scale while improving internal engineering standards, tooling, and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend balance management platform and build out new fund accessibility platforms leveraged by enterprises and SMBs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally across infrastructure and product teams to deliver innovative solutions that address evolving user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have a Bachelor&#39;s degree or foreign equivalent in Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, or a related field, plus five (5) years of progressive, post-baccalaureate related work experience in software engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have five (5) years of experience in each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large-scale financial tracking systems;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud-based services including: gRPC, GraphQL, Docker/Kubernetes, or AWS;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, development, and operation of mission-critical gRPC services; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software Architecture and system design, debugging/troubleshooting, and API development and design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have one (1) year of experience in the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, development, and operation of public web APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
